      "selection_rule": "Select 16 exact decoded entries by upstream array index to cover empty and escaped strings, C0 and terminal controls, BOM, non-ASCII and emoji, bidirectional controls, shell/XML/format-shaped inert data, traversal, and Windows device names. Store index-value records using deterministic ASCII-escaped JSON; no entry is executed or interpreted as markup.",
