      "license": "MIT",
      "license_file": "LICENSE-JSONTestSuite.txt",
      "selection_rule": "Copy nine fixtures byte-for-byte: four required-valid cases for whitespace/nesting, duplicate keys, escaped NUL, and surrogate pairs; four required-invalid cases for a leading plus, trailing comma, invalid Unicode escape, and incomplete structure; and one implementation-defined huge exponent case. Every selected fixture is at most 137 bytes."
    }
